{"appendix":false,"contribution_target":{"fingerprint":"sha256:a8d781665bcf9635879f957fe74091d0100b45643c6431e10990edf2709d1841","grain":"paper-statement","id":"A-polynomial-time-construction-of-strong-thin-trees-September-23-2026#thm:tt-algorithm","title":"Algorithmic strong thin trees"},"credit":{"kind":"producer-declared","license":null,"license_status":"consult-source-notice","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","repository":"https://github.com/openai/math","source":"lean/formalization.yaml","source_registry":"index.json#/sources"},"detail":{"path":"../rows/98fa9c4135f78f81b6d4bab7.json","pointer":"/row"},"display":"Theorem","generation_id":"sha256:fda4c3462963b650c538e2177794811eb1c221b267efea4b091fd6e397533f81","id":"r:A-polynomial-time-construction-of-strong-thin-trees-September-23-2026:thm:tt-algorithm","kind":"statement-detail","manuscript_id":"p:A-polynomial-time-construction-of-strong-thin-trees-September-23-2026","name":"Algorithmic strong thin trees","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","printed_number":null,"printed_number_provenance":null,"printed_number_status":"unavailable","reading_page":"papers/A-polynomial-time-construction-of-strong-thin-trees-September-23-2026.html#thm:tt-algorithm","release_id":"openai-math","schema":"statement-map-web/2","section":1,"section_title":"Introduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:b1ad0723697d79821359147799fd06cf30a40023916b23f958bbcfae76c414f8","file":"preprints/A-polynomial-time-construction-of-strong-thin-trees-September-23-2026/build/source/sections/main-theorem.tex","line":1,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":null,"provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/A-polynomial-time-construction-of-strong-thin-trees-September-23-2026/build/source/sections/main-theorem.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:b1ad0723697d79821359147799fd06cf30a40023916b23f958bbcfae76c414f8","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/A-polynomial-time-construction-of-strong-thin-trees-September-23-2026/build/source/sections/main-theorem.tex#L1"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:tt-algorithm}\nThere is an absolute constant $C$ with the following property. Given a\nfinite $k$-edge-connected multigraph $G$ on at least one vertex and\nan integer $k\\ge1$,\na deterministic algorithm returns a spanning tree $T$ satisfying\n\\begin{equation}\n |\\delta_T(S)|\\le \\frac Ck\\,|\\delta_G(S)|\n       \\qquad(\\varnothing\\ne S\\subsetneq V(G))\n \\label{eq:ta-thin}\n\\end{equation}\nin time polynomial in the total binary input length, whether edges\nare listed explicitly or multiplicities are encoded in binary.\nFor a one-vertex graph the answer is the empty tree."}
